<title>USA: USDA extends $6 mln in GSM-103 credits to Lebanon.</title>
<headline>USDA extends $6 mln in GSM-103 credits to Lebanon.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Agriculture Department Friday said it authorized $6 million in credit guarantees for sales of U.S. breeder livestock to Lebanon under the longer-term GSM-103 program for fiscal year 1997.</p>
</text>
